<title>JAPAN: Sawai Pharmaceutical -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sawai Pharmaceutical -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  8.30		vs	    9.04</p>
<p> Operating	  428    million	  vs	    1.49</p>
<p> Current	    331    million	  vs	    1.23</p>
<p> Net		  197    million	  vs	  688    million</p>
<p> EPS		   18.71 yen	  vs	   69.96 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Sawai Pharmaceutical Co Ltd is a producer and retailer of medicines for medical treatment.</p>
